{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '2038,2068p' src/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc; rg -n -g '*.clj*' '\\\\bbundled-uast\\\\b|dsg__get' src/cljc/yang/clojure* test/yang\"","aggregated_output":"\n(defn- with-runtime\n  \"Wrap a unit in its clj entry boundary and install the bundled runtime.\"\n  [ast linked? env]\n  (let [ast (if (seq (::local-fns env))\n              (u/let1 'dsg__local_fns (u/sexp->uast '(cell/new {}))\n                (u/let1 'dsg__invoke_dynamic\n                  (u/lam '[callee args dispatch]\n                         (guest-call-routing (u/v 'callee) (u/v 'args) (u/v 'dispatch) env))\n                  (apply u/app (u/lam '[dsg__make_local dsg__invoke_local] ast)\n                         (map u/sexp->uast local-call-runtime))))\n              ast)\n        unit (u/app (u/v 'clj/run-unit) (u/lam [] ast))\n        helpers (u/let1 'dsg__ex_message (u/sexp->uast ex-message-form)\n                        (u/let1 'dsg__ex_data (u/sexp->uast ex-data-form) unit))]\n    (if linked?\n      helpers\n      (u/then prelude/bundled-uast helpers))))\n\n\n(defn compile-program\n  \"Compile a sequence of Clojure forms into a single Universal AST.\n   Top-level defs compile to explicit yin/def store writes, sequenced via lambda.\n   Top-level defmacros are lowered to ordinary (yin/def name (fn ...)) syntax\n   with :macro? true on the lambda; the encoder turns that flag into a\n   declaration row and the expander, not this compiler, recognizes calls.\n   The three-argument form takes `opts` opting into the argument-vector\n   convention (see `program-env`); without it the output is the native one.\"\n  ([forms] (compile-program forms true))\n  ([forms tail?] (compile-program forms tail? nil))\n  ([forms tail? opts]\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure.cljc:2055:      (u/then prelude/bundled-uast helpers))))\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure/prelude.cljc:205:(def bundled-uast\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure/prelude.cljc:208:                      (u/v 'dsg__get) (u/v 'dsg__equal) (u/v 'dsg__assoc)\nsrc/cljc/yang/clojure/prelude.cljc:211:           (u/lam '[dsg__get dsg__equal dsg__assoc dsg__add dsg__lte]\ntest/yang/clojure_test.clj:1439:                       (u/app (u/app (u/v 'dsg__get) (u/v 'invocation) (u/lit :yang.call/raise))\ntest/yang/rt/effect_test.cljc:321:                      (u/then (if bundled? prelude/bundled-uast (u/sexp->uast '(require 'clj)))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
